WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.281
The estimate waits three days because nobody owns the missing specifications.

00:00:04.281 --> 00:00:10.118
The symptom looks like a slow estimate, but the friction is at the input handoff.

00:00:10.118 --> 00:00:13.621
Automating the final email cannot remove the earlier delay.

00:00:13.621 --> 00:00:19.069
We first need to confirm the cause and assign responsibility for clarifying incomplete requests.
